					(reference "#PWR097")
					(unit 1)
				)
			)
		)
	)
	(text "FT602 VCC33 / VDDA / VCCIO (3V3)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20683c96-d20b-4e3e-b23d-d57ca425dd1a")
	)
	(text "5150UVC: RCA composite video -> TVP5150AM1 -> GW2AR-18 FPGA -> FT602 -> USB 3 UVC webcam"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 302.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5e6c41b2-2239-491f-b308-284eb0c11f4f")
	)
	(text "BT.656 8-bit @ 27 MHz into the FPGA. The FPGA weaves fields in its 64 Mbit SDRAM and streams YUY2\nto the FT602 (245 synchronous FIFO, 32-bit @ 100 MHz). The FT602 enumerates as UVC and tells the\nFPGA (its I2C slave) the selected format. The FPGA is I2C master to the TVP5150 on a separate bus.\nAll 66 FPGA user I/O are used: see docs/pin_assignment.csv.\nGowin settings: enable \"SSPI as regular IO\" and \"MSPI as regular IO\"."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 309.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8f77bce5-9b1e-48b2-9602-1372ce79bc41")
	)
	(text "REVIEW FLAGS (not verified from the downloaded documents)\n1. FT602 FPGA-side protocol (frame marking, I2C slave register map) is in FTDI AN_434: not downloaded.\n2. QN88 footprint is a placeholder (ArtInChip QFN-88 10x10): check pads and EP against Gowin UG229.\n3. RCA jack J1 has no footprint: pick a part (e.g. CUI RCJ-01x).\n4. Crystal load caps assume CL = 18 pF: recalculate for the parts bought.\n5. No anti-aliasing filter on the video input (TI recommends one).\n6. USBLC6 is drawn flow-through: route D+/D- into pins 1/3 and out of 6/4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 340.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c00e1995-fe38-4662-9d4c-2ed577297c7c")
	)
